---@field period_start? string Start of the evaluation window covered by this report.
---@field period_end? string End of the evaluation window covered by this report.
---@field delivery_status? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportRunDeliveryStatusEnum Delivery result: 'pending', 'generated', 'delivered', 'partial_failure', or 'failed'. * `pending` - Pending * `generated` - Generated * `delivered` - Delivered * `partial_failure` - Partial Failure * `failed` - Failed
---@field delivery_errors? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportRunDeliveryErrorsList Delivery error messages. Empty when all configured deliveries succeeded.
---@field created_at? string When this report run was created.

---@class posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportRunContent
---@field evaluation_target? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationTargetEnum Evaluation target analyzed by this report run. Legacy runs without this field targeted generations. * `generation` - Generation * `trace` - Trace * `session` - Session
---@field title? string Agent-generated report headline.
---@field sections? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportRunContentSectionsList Ordered narrative sections in the report.
---@field citations? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportRunContentCitationsList References grounding findings in the report.
---@field generation_status? posthog.llm_analytics.GenerationStatusEnum Whether report generation completed or metrics were temporarily unavailable. Legacy runs without this field completed normally. * `completed` - completed * `metrics_unavailable` - metrics_unavailable
---@field metrics? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportMetrics|distilled.Null Structured metrics for completed reports, or null when metrics were temporarily unavailable.

