---@class posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportUpdate
---@field id string
---@field evaluation string UUID of the evaluation this report config belongs to.
---@field frequency? posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationReportFrequencyEnum How report generation is triggered. 'every_n' fires once N new evaluation results have accumulated (subject to cooldown_minutes and daily_run_cap). 'scheduled' fires on the cadence defined by rrule. * `scheduled` - Scheduled * `every_n` - Every N
---@field rrule? string RFC 5545 recurrence rule string for scheduled reports. Only daily and weekly cadences are supported: use 'FREQ=DAILY' or 'FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,FR'. Required when frequency is 'scheduled'; ignored otherwise.
---@field starts_at string|distilled.Null Read-only anchor datetime used to expand scheduled reports. The server sets this automatically when a report is switched to scheduled mode.
---@field timezone_name string Read-only timezone used for scheduled reports. Evaluation reports use UTC.
---@field next_delivery_date string|distilled.Null
---@field delivery_targets? any List of delivery targets. Each entry is either {type: 'email', value: 'user@example.com'} or {type: 'slack', integration_id: <int>, channel: '<channel>'}. Slack integration_id must belong to this team.
---@field max_sample_size? number Maximum number of evaluation runs included in each report. Defaults to 200.
---@field enabled? boolean Whether report delivery is active. Disabled configs do not fire.
---@field deleted boolean Read-only. Report configs are soft-deleted only when their evaluation is deleted. Use enabled=false to stop deliveries.
---@field last_delivered_at string|distilled.Null
---@field generated_report_count number Number of reports generated from this evaluation report config.
---@field last_generated_at string|distilled.Null When the most recent report was generated, or null if no reports have been generated.
---@field report_prompt_guidance? string Optional custom instructions appended to the AI report prompt to steer focus, scope, or section choices without modifying the base prompt.
---@field trigger_threshold? number|distilled.Null Number of new evaluation results that triggers a report (every_n mode only). Min 100, max 10000. Defaults to 100. Required when frequency is 'every_n'.
---@field cooldown_minutes? number Minimum minutes between count-triggered reports to prevent spam (every_n mode only). Min 60, max 1440 (24 hours). Defaults to 60.
---@field daily_run_cap? number Maximum count-triggered report runs per calendar day (UTC). Min 1, max 24 (one per cooldown window). Defaults to 10.
---@field created_by number|distilled.Null
---@field created_at string

---* `generation` - Generation
---* `trace` - Trace
---* `session` - Session
---@alias posthog.llm_analytics.EvaluationTargetEnum "generation"|"trace"|"session"

---* `completed` - completed
---* `metrics_unavailable` - metrics_unavailable
---@alias posthog.llm_analytics.GenerationStatusEnum "completed"|"metrics_unavailable"

